official_text:
Approval by the Board of Education of Amendment No. 1, Joint Use Agreement Between the Oakland Unified School District and the Alameda County Office of Education Regarding 750 International Blvd., extending the term of the Agreement from July 1, 2020 through June 30, 2023 to June 30, 2028, for payments from latter as follows:
2023-24 Fiscal Year: $45,000.00;
2024-25 Fiscal Year: $47,250.00;
2025-26 Fiscal Year: $49,612.50;
2026-27 Fiscal Year: $52,093.13;
2027-28 Fiscal Year: $54,697.78
Each annual payment shall be due in full on December 31 of each fiscal year; with District responsible for maintain building integrity, responsible for any required major repairs and upgrades; adding termination cause for convenience, each change, as more specifically set forth in the Amended Sections of Agreement. All other terms and conditions of the Agreement remain in full force and effect.
